Z||000006||Ali_Gulf_Fiero||11-06-2001||08:52 PM||||Wow, that takes me back 10 years. I had a Daytona. The stripped down CS with the Turbo II engine. That car SCREWED! I beat a hopped-up AMX a friend owned, and his other car - a Javelin.<BR>I made sure to race the AMX on a business park entrance road. Ingress and Egress sides diveded by a grassy median. I kicked that 396's A$$. When we dragged later on on a straight, he creamed me. Wah!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>my cat's sitting in my scrambled eggs.||||reg||1
